StormFS LXDM theme
==================

This package installs the StormFS greeter theme and the default LXDM
configuration used by the StormFS Linux ISO.

Contents
--------
  /etc/lxdm/lxdm.conf
  /usr/share/lxdm/themes/StormFS/gtkrc
  /usr/share/lxdm/themes/StormFS/greeter.ui
  /usr/share/lxdm/themes/StormFS/index.theme
  /usr/share/lxdm/themes/StormFS/background.jpg
  /usr/share/lxdm/themes/StormFS/login.svg

The greeter layout is derived from LXDM 0.5.3's Industrial theme, which is
distributed under the GNU General Public License version 3 or later.  The
StormFS color work, login wordmark, and configuration are StormFS-specific.
The background is the StormFS "Lightning" wallpaper also shipped with the
StormFS installer.
